      gainRep('badlands', 10);
      gainRep('hoboCamp', 5);
      return `They look at you for a long time.\n"Vera." They try the name out.\n"I filed a complaint when they gave us three days notice. Through the company's internal process." They almost smile. "I received a form letter two months later that said the dissolution was legal and the complaint was closed."\nThey look at the wall.\n"A real complaint. External. With evidence." They're quiet.\n"The company's dissolved. Complaints survive dissolution — if someone knows how to file them properly." They meet your eyes.\n"She'd want deposition from people who worked here. I have names. Fifteen people who can testify about the supply chain, the ore runs, the sealed crates." A pause.\n"Tell her to come here when she's ready. I'll be here." They say it simply. Like it's nothing. Like three years in the ruins is just where they live.`;
